{"candidateAnswer":"Yes, they both have dogs.","evidence":"[D1:12 | 3:47 pm on 17 March, 2022] James: It would be cool! For example, we could write some kind of application for dogs. By the way, my dogs.\n[D2:18 | 9:26 pm on 20 March, 2022] John: Aww, they're adorable! Pets are the best - they must make life so much better. I want one so bad, but I'm not there yet. Someday!","itemId":"urn:uuid:3eb6f874-20f7-5aa3-af32-65473f2efbc9","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:a3be8d40c45287e7fbee288bc00ee33d37ac18b2ed5a6d46a4b328027a8dbc9c","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Do both James and John have pets?","referenceAnswer":"No","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"a3be8d40c45287e7fbee288bc00ee33d37ac18b2ed5a6d46a4b328027a8dbc9c"}}]}